                    </div>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold">Verifikasi OTP</h2>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 mt-1 text-sm">Kode dikirim ke <span id="phone-target" class="text-slate-900 font-bold"></span></p>
                </div>
